guacamole-server: Apache Guacamole is a clientless remote desktop gateway. It supports 
guacamole-server: standard protocols like VNC, RDP, and SSH. We call it clientless 
guacamole-server: because no plugins or client software are required. Thanks to HTML5,
guacamole-server: once Guacamole is installed on a server, all you need to access your
guacamole-server: desktops is a web browser.
